{"recall":{"defs":[["RAG","Retrieve relevant text and add it to the prompt before generating."],["Parametric knowledge","What the model stores in its weights."],["Embedding","Vector representation of text for similarity search."],["Cosine similarity","q·d / (|q||d|)."],["BM25","Keyword ranking with IDF, saturation and length normalisation."],["Hybrid retrieval","Combining dense and sparse results."],["Reciprocal rank fusion","Score = Σ 1/(60 + rank) across rankers."],["Chunking","Splitting documents into retrievable passages."],["Reranker","Accurate second-stage scorer, often a cross-encoder."],["Text-to-SQL","Translating a question into an executable database query."]],"formulas":["\\cos(q,d)=\\frac{q\\cdot d}{\\|q\\|\\|d\\|}","\\text{BM25}=\\sum_w \\text{IDF}(w)\\frac{f(k_1+1)}{f+k_1(1-b+b|d|/\\text{avgdl})}","\\text{IDF}(w)=\\ln\\!\\Big(1+\\frac{N-n_w+0.5}{n_w+0.5}\\Big)","\\text{RRF}(d)=\\sum_r \\frac{1}{60+\\text{rank}_r(d)}","\\text{step}=\\text{size}-\\text{overlap}"],"takeaways":["Open-book answers.","Dense for meaning, BM25 for terms.","Chunk sensibly.","Rerank for precision.","Query tables, don't embed them."],"confused":[["RAG vs fine-tuning","Add facts at query time vs change behaviour in weights."],["Bi-encoder vs cross-encoder","Separate embeddings (fast) vs joint scoring (accurate)."],["Recall vs precision in retrieval","Did we fetch the right chunk vs how much noise came with it."],["Fixed vs semantic chunking","By length vs by topic shifts."],["Dense vs sparse","Embedding vectors vs term-based scores."]],"minute":"RAG adds retrieved text to the prompt: current and private knowledge, citations, easy updates; better than fine-tuning for facts. Offline: chunk, embed, index with metadata. Online: retrieve top-k, augment (answer from context, cite, say unknown), generate. Dense: bi-encoder embeddings, cosine q·d/|q||d| ((1,2),(2,1) → 0.8), ANN indexes (HNSW, IVF); catches paraphrases, misses exact codes. BM25: IDF × saturated term frequency (k₁ ≈ 1.5) with length normalisation (b ≈ 0.75); exact terms, no synonyms. Hybrid via RRF Σ 1/(60 + rank). Chunking: fixed + overlap, structure-aware, semantic; few hundred tokens. Reranking: cross-encoder over top 50–100 → keep 3–10. Tables: text-to-SQL/code and execution (Q2 max → Chennai 175; Pune total 270)."},"flashcards":[["Three problems RAG addresses","Knowledge cut-off, private data, hallucination"],["RAG vs fine-tuning for facts","RAG"],["Online RAG steps","Retrieve, augment, generate"],["Where RAG fails","Indexing, chunking, retrieval recall/precision, generation"],["Cosine of (1,2), (2,1)","0.8"],["ANN index examples","HNSW, IVF"],["BM25 k₁ controls…","Term-frequency saturation"],["RRF formula","Σ 1/(60 + rank)"],["Why overlap chunks?","Keep boundary facts whole"],["Typical chunk size","A few hundred tokens"],["Reranker type","Cross-encoder"],["Retrieve-then-rerank sizes","Top 50–100 → keep 3–10"],["Tabular question approach","Text-to-SQL / code execution"],["Highest Q2 sales in the example","Chennai, 175"],["Dense retrieval weakness","Exact identifiers and rare terms"]],"coverage":{"topics":[{"simple":["what","why","h1"],"deep":["l12-why"],"viz":["lmWhyRag"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h2"],"deep":["l12-framework"],"viz":["lmRagPipe"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h3","example"],"deep":["l12-dense"],"viz":["lmCosine"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h4","demo"],"deep":["l12-bm25"],"viz":["lmHybrid","lmRagSorter"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h5"],"deep":["l12-chunk"],"viz":["lmChunk"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h6"],"deep":["l12-rerank"],"viz":["lmRerank"],"status":"complete"},{"simple":["h7"],"deep":["l12-table"],"viz":["lmTableRag"],"status":"complete"}],"elements":[["Parametric vs non-parametric knowledge","concept","l12-why"],["Open-book analogy","analogy","l12-why"],["Indexing pipeline","method","l12-framework"],["Failure points","concept","l12-framework"],["Cosine formula","formula","l12-dense"],["Cosine worked example","worked example","l12-dense"],["ANN search","concept","l12-dense"],["BM25 formula","formula","l12-bm25"],["Hybrid with RRF","method","l12-bm25"],["Chunking strategies","method","l12-chunk"],["Chunk size trade-off","concept","l12-chunk"],["Cross-encoder reranking","method","l12-rerank"],["Reranking worked","worked example","l12-rerank"],["Text-to-SQL for tables","method","l12-table"],["Sales table worked","worked example","l12-table"]]},"topicSection":{"Why retrieval":"l12-why","RAG framework":"l12-framework","Dense retrieval":"l12-dense","BM25 and hybrid":"l12-bm25","Chunking":"l12-chunk","Reranking":"l12-rerank","Tabular RAG":"l12-table"}}